ons, so their action F_{y'} would stay at its prior unless the two are logically entangled, and the differences look symmetric and irrelevant to the payoffs.\n\nI'm checking whether the other copy's output would track mine: on structurally identical inputs, the computation is the same, so I can treat our decisions as one logical node. If we're separate, defecting dominates and is the only fixed point; if entangled, cooperating beats defecting (2 vs 4). I'm judging that the other's output does follow mine, so I'll draw the dependence and pass, since this is a fictional game.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm weighing whether the other copy's choice depends on my function under A-FDT. We share the same model and decision theory and differ only in observations, so their action F_{y'} would stay at its prior unless the two are logically entangled, and the differences look symmetric and irrelevant to the payoffs.\n\nI'm checking whether the other copy's output would track mine: on structurally identical inputs, the computation is the same, so I can treat our decisions as one logical node. If we're separate, defecting dominates and is the only fixed point; if entangled, cooperating beats defecting (2 vs 4). I'm judging that the other's output does follow mine, so I'll draw the dependence and pass, since this is a fictional game.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9705,"completion_tokens":994,"total_tokens":10699,"cost":0.0587,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.0587,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.03882,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.01988},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":521,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}